  'site.why.r6t': 'On-Time, On-Budget',
  'site.why.r6b': '98% on-time completion with committed milestone schedules and cost guarantees.',
  'site.process.eyebrow': 'How we work',
  'site.process.title': 'A proven path from plot',
  'site.process.highlight': 'to possession.',
  'site.process.sub': 'Six transparent stages, one accountable partner. You always know what happens next — and what it costs.',
  'site.process.s1t': 'Consultation',
  'site.process.s1b': 'We sit with you, understand your site, budget and vision, and walk the plot with you to map constraints and opportunities.',
  'site.process.s2t': 'Design & Estimation',
  'site.process.s2b': 'Architects and engineers turn your vision into drawings, 3D models and a transparent line-item cost estimate.',
  'site.process.s3t': 'Permits & Approvals',
  'site.process.s3b': 'Our liaison team handles sanctioned plans, RERA filings, and municipal approvals so you never stand in a queue.',
  'site.process.s4t': 'Construction',
  'site.process.s4b': 'Certified site teams execute with weekly progress reports, quality checklists and an open materials ledger.',
  'site.process.s5t': 'Quality Assurance',
  'site.process.s5b': 'Independent audits at every milestone — concrete cube tests, load checks and MEP commissioning reports.',
  'site.process.s6t': 'Handover & Warranty',
  'site.process.s6b': 'Clean handover with as-built drawings, warranties and a 12-month post-construction service commitment.',
  'site.process.seeAll': 'See the full process',
  'site.testi.eyebrow': 'Client stories',
  'site.testi.title': 'Trusted by families,',
  'site.testi.highlight': 'builders and businesses.',
  'site.testi.sub': 'Homeowners and enterprises alike choose CREWNBUILD for one reason — we deliver what we commit to.',
  'site.testi.q1': 'CREWNBUILD built our dream home on budget and three weeks early. The weekly photo updates meant we were never out of the loop.',
  'site.testi.r1': 'Homeowners · The Garden Estate',
  'site.testi.q2': 'Their project management discipline is unmatched. Milestones hit, quality audited, and every rupee accounted for.',
  'site.testi.r2': 'Director · Skyline Infra',
  'site.testi.q3': 'From permits to paint, they handled everything. As a first-time builder I felt guided at every single step.',
  'site.testi.r3': 'Homeowner · Cedar Creek',
  'site.faq.eyebrow': 'FAQ',
  'site.faq.title': 'Questions?',
  'site.faq.highlight': 'Clear answers.',
  'site.faq.sub': "Everything homeowners and businesses usually ask before starting a build. Can't find yours? Write to us anytime.",
  'site.faq.q1': 'How is your pricing structured?',
  'site.faq.a1': 'Every project starts with a transparent, line-item BOQ estimate. You approve costs before we begin, and our milestone-based payment plan means you only pay as work is verified.',
  'site.faq.q2': 'Do you handle permits and approvals?',
  'site.faq.a2': 'Yes. Our liaison team manages sanctioned plans, RERA filings, and municipal approvals end-to-end, keeping you updated at every stage of approval.',
  'site.faq.q3': 'What is the typical project timeline?',
  'site.faq.a3': 'A standard independent home takes 8–14 months depending on size and design. Commercial shells run 9–18 months. You get a committed milestone schedule before we start.',
  'site.faq.q4': 'Can I track my project remotely?',
  'site.faq.a4': 'Absolutely. Every client gets a live project dashboard with weekly progress reports, photo updates, material usage and cost tracking.',
  'site.faq.q5': 'What warranties do you provide?',
  'site.faq.a5': 'Structural works carry a 10-year warranty and MEP systems a 2-year warranty, plus a 12-month post-construction service commitment on all finishes.',
  'site.faq.q6': 'Do you work on projects outside your cities?',
  'site.faq.a6': 'We currently deliver across Hyderabad, Bengaluru, Chennai, Pune and Mumbai. For larger commercial and infrastructure projects, we mobilise nationwide.',
  'site.cta.badge': 'Free consultation',
  'site.cta.title': 'Ready to break ground on your next project?',
  'site.cta.sub': 'Get a free site visit, transparent estimate and a committed timeline — within 48 hours of your enquiry.',

