  'site.calculators.raw.method': 'Built-up area × published consumption per sq.ft. Quantities are shown as ranges because the underlying thumb rules are ranges — for example cement at {low}–{high} bags per sq.ft. This is a planning estimate for an ordinary RCC-framed residential building, not a bill of quantities: real figures come from the structural drawings, bar bending schedule and BOQ, and site wastage is not included. Rates from published Indian construction thumb rules (civiconcepts, bricknbolt, houseyog).',
