  'site.calculators.vastu.component.houseInPlot': 'House / Plot Direction',
  'site.calculators.vastu.principle.mainDoor': 'The entrance is traditionally placed towards the North-East, East or North, where the morning sun enters; the South-West is the least favoured corner for it.',
  'site.calculators.vastu.principle.kitchen': 'Agni, the fire element, governs the South-East, which is the traditional place for a kitchen; the North-East is the least favoured.',
  'site.calculators.vastu.principle.masterBedroom': 'The South-West is associated with weight and stability and is the traditional place for the head of the household; the North-East is the least favoured.',
  'site.calculators.vastu.principle.childrensBedroom': 'The North-West and South-East are the traditional choices for a children\'s room; the South-West, reserved for the head of the household, is the least favoured.',
  'site.calculators.vastu.principle.guestRoom': 'The North-West is associated with movement and short stays, which suits a guest room; the South-West is the least favoured.',
  'site.calculators.vastu.principle.diningRoom': 'A dining space traditionally sits to the East or North, close to the kitchen; the South-West is the least favoured.',
  'site.calculators.vastu.principle.well': 'Water sources are traditionally placed in the North-East, the direction associated with water; the South-West is the least favoured.',
  'site.calculators.vastu.principle.toilet': 'Sanitary areas are traditionally kept to the North-West or West and away from the North-East, which is treated as the most sacred corner.',
  'site.calculators.vastu.principle.garage': 'Vehicle parking is traditionally kept to the North-West; the South-West is the least favoured.',
  'site.calculators.vastu.principle.houseInPlot': 'The built mass traditionally sits towards the South-West of the plot, leaving the open space to the North-East.',
