  'site.calculators.vastu.favourableCount': 'Favourable ({count})',
  'site.calculators.vastu.attentionCount': 'Needs attention ({count})',
  'site.calculators.vastu.method': 'Each placement carries a traditional preference score from 3 (least favoured) to 10 (most favoured) for each of the eight directions. The compliance figure is the average of the placements you selected, expressed out of 100 — so the scale runs from 30% to 100%, because even the least favoured direction scores 3. Above 70% is treated as good and above 90% as excellent. Parts of the house you leave unselected are not scored at all, rather than counted as zero.',
  'site.calculators.vastu.noteLabel': 'Please note:',
  'site.calculators.vastu.note': 'this is traditional Vastu guidance offered for information only. It is not a scientific assessment and carries no guarantee, and it is not a substitute for professional architectural, structural, engineering or qualified Vastu consultation. Always confirm any building decision with the relevant professional.',
  'site.calculators.plan.title': 'Upload Your Plan',
