  'site.calculators.plan.method': 'Each room\'s direction is the bearing from the centre point you set to the marker you placed, rotated by the orientation you confirmed — so it comes from the plan itself rather than from an assumption about which way it was drawn. The scoring is the calculator\'s own: a traditional preference score from 3 to 10 per direction, averaged over the rooms you marked and expressed out of 100, which is why the scale runs 30% to 100%. Rooms you do not mark are not scored. Nothing is uploaded or stored — the plan stays in your browser.',
