  'site.calculators.propertyRoi.futurePartial': 'Enter both the expected annual appreciation and the projection period to see an illustrative future value.',
  'site.calculators.propertyRoi.method': 'Appreciation = current value − purchase price. CAGR = (current value ÷ purchase price)^(1 ÷ years owned) − 1, with years owned counted from the two dates (fractional years allowed). Annual gross rent = monthly rent × (12 − vacancy months). Total invested cost = purchase price + purchase costs + annual maintenance × years owned + renovation + other costs. Net ROI = net profit ÷ total invested cost × 100. Future value = current value × (1 + rate)^years.',
